{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちま〜\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は暖かくて、上着がいらないくらいでしたね＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽかぽかで気持ち良かったぁ☆★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは質問お答えしまーす(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.みそかつ以外にも名古屋っぽいものとか食べた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→はい!きしめんを食べました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも食べている麺よりも、太くて美味しかったです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.好きなキャラクターは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→キャラクターは、それぞれに違う可愛さがあって何でも好きです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間お母さんが子供の頃に、私に買ってくれたメモ帳を見つけ、それが「アドちゃん」だったんです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近...アドちゃんの可愛さを発見しました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.いきものがかりさんの曲で1番好きなのは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→「ありがとう」です*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4.好きなアニメや漫画は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→僕等がいた...＊*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5.「乃木坂浪漫」に日奈は登場する？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→まだわからないです...(´・_・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日にちが決まったときには、きちんとお伝えします+*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6.手紙届いたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どのタイミングで受け取ってるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→はい!きちんと受け取ってます*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1枚1枚、何度も読み返して読ませてもらってます゜+.(・∀・).+゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7.目標とする芸人は誰？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→芸人？...芸人..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白鳥みれいさん..なんちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柳原かなこさんも好きです+"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芸能人だったら、女優の綾瀬はるかさんです＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8.好きな色は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→オレンジ色と、乃木坂カラーである紫色です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9.抹茶好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→はい!大好きです+"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飲み物や御菓子、アイスなどは抹茶が大好きです+*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10.寝るときはどんな格好？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→うーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・・・・・・・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通のパジャマですよ♪えへっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11.ピルクル好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→乳酸菌飲料のピルクル？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乳酸菌飲料は基本大好きです+*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12.道明寺餅と長命寿餅どっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→日奈は関東風の長命寿餅は、よく食べますが、関西風の道明寺餅も食べてみたいです(´・ω・)o━○●◎-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13.最近ヘビロテしてる曲は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→1曲にこだわらず、色んな曲をローテーションして聞いてます☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきものがかりさんや奥華子さん、少女時代さんKARAさんの曲をたくさん聞きます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14.野球やってるんだけど、甲子園出たら応援してくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→もちろんもちろん!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甲子園...青春ですよねO(*・ω・*)O゛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15.日奈がとくに仲が良いのは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→やっぱり、同じ年のみなみや川後のひなさんかな+*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで終わーり／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/12/3051170/0000.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑みなみと日奈＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真は、まりかが撮って加工してくれました★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、おやすみ〜＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな"}],"source":"archive"}